## Input variables

This agent expects values supplied when the call starts:

{{range .CallStartVars}}- `{{.Name}}` ({{.Type}}){{if .Required}} — required{{end}}
{{end}}
Locally, pass them with `unmute dev` on the source package:

```sh
unmute dev <source-dir>{{range .CallStartVars}} --var {{.Name}}=...{{end}}
```

In production the same values ride the job dispatch metadata as one flat JSON
object under `call_start`, for example:

```sh
lk dispatch create --room <room> --agent-name {{.AgentName}} \
  --metadata '{"call_start": { {{range $i, $v := .CallStartVars}}{{if $i}}, {{end}}"{{$v.Name}}": "..."{{end}} }}'
```
